ge":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_026_s5","report_id":"v3feat_026","text":"As shown in Figure 1, MobileNet scores 16.8 points higher on CIFAR-10 than on SVHN.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_026_s6","report_id":"v3feat_026","text":"On CIFAR-10, MobileNet obtains a F1 score of 80.6% (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_026_s7","report_id":"v3feat_026","text":"On SST-2, MobileNet obtains a F1 score of 57.3%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_026_s8","report_id":"v3feat_026","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_026_s9","report_id":"v3feat_026","text":"Transformer has a loss of about 0.9 at epoch 10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_026_s10","report_id":"v3feat_026","text":"Transformer has a loss of 0.254 at epoch 90.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_026_s11","report_id":"v3feat_026","text":"As shown in Figure 2, at epoch 20, the loss of BERT-base is about 1.0.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_026_s12","report_id":"v3feat_026","text":"Logistic Regression reaches 50.4% accuracy on SST-2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_026_s13","report_id":"v3feat_026","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null}]}